      "reason": "A conditional workload-to-credential path is supported by the deployed application source and raw configuration. Wrex has ec2:*; it can discover the instance and modify its security-group ingress. The application performs an arbitrary URL GET and returns the response. With IMDSv1 allowed, that SSRF can disclose the attached EC2 role credentials, whose policy grants s3:* on all resources, including the private secret bucket. This is potential reachability, not a verified runtime exploit.",
